{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/axsbmt4b","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":115,"width":1120,"height":100},"text":"应用场景：设备任务如何分配","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#142A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/by1cvy5g","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":80,"top":245,"width":1100,"height":390},"text":"工厂中有 4 个摄像头分析任务，附近有 2 台边缘服务器。\n每个任务可在本地处理，也可卸载到一台边缘服务器。\n目标：在服务器容量有限的情况下，降低任务总时延。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#334B60","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/k3atsnmd","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":1120,"top":650,"width":80,"height":30},"text":"02","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7B8D9F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/klyrdk","slideIndex":1,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/q67fj3","slideIndex":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/d0j6d0va","name":"Blank"},"title":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(247,249,252,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pof2p47e","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":50,"width":1000,"height":35},"text":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#167D9A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2loje9on","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":115,"width":1120,"height":100},"text":"为什么使用遗传算法","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#142A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3mxknep8","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":80,"top":245,"width":1100,"height":390},"text":"每个任务有 3 种处理位置，4 个任务共有 3⁴ = 81 种方案。\n任务数量增加时，组合数量迅速增长。\n遗传算法迭代搜索较好的分配方案，不保证全局最优。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#334B60","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gj61cz6h","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":1120,"top":650,"width":80,"height":30},"text":"03","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7B8D9F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/q67fj3","slideIndex":2,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/zmaiuw","slideIndex":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/d0j6d0va","name":"Blank"},"title":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(247,249,252,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/725gje98","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":50,"width":1000,"height":35},"text":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#167D9A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/83ehsjqd","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":115,"width":1120,"height":100},"text":"编码：一条染色体代表一个方案","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#142A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t4nylory","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":80,"top":245,"width":1100,"height":390},"text":"约定 0 = 本地，1 = 边缘服务器 A，2 = 边缘服务器 B。\n示例染色体：[0, 1, 2, 1]\n任务 1 在本地，任务 2 和 4 在 A，任务 3 在 B。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#334B60","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u5wzut8j","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":1120,"top":650,"width":80,"height":30},"text":"04","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7B8D9F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/zmaiuw","slideIndex":3,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/0o6d4c","slideIndex":4,"layout":{"id":"ly/d0j6d0va","name":"Blank"},"title":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(247,249,252,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8rup8vyl","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":50,"width":1000,"height":35},"text":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#167D9A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nql8zqx0","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":115,"width":1120,"height":100},"text":"适应度：评价一个分配方案","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#142A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mps76lgf","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":80,"top":245,"width":1100,"height":390},"text":"任务时延：本地计算时间，或传输时间 + 边缘计算与等待时间。\n优化目标：最小化所有任务时延之和。\n服务器负载超过容量时，增加惩罚值。\n适应度 = 1 / (1 + 总时延 + 惩罚)，越大越好。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#334B60","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/xw3q50f2","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":1120,"top":650,"width":80,"height":30},"text":"05","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7B8D9F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/0o6d4c","slideIndex":4,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/6xp5i1","slideIndex":5,"layout":{"id":"ly/d0j6d0va","name":"Blank"},"title":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","textShapes":4,"backgroundColor":"rgba(247,249,252,1)"}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ny5kbu1g","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":50,"width":1000,"height":35},"text":"边缘计算 / 遗传算法","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#167D9A","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ozylkz21","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":115,"width":1120,"height":100},"text":"遗传算法的迭代过程","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#142A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p072d4jm","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":245,"width":1100,"height":390},"text":"① 随机生成一批方案，计算各方案的适应度。\n② 优先选择表现较好的方案作为父代。\n③ 交叉组合父代，随机变异部分任务的位置。\n④ 保留较优方案，重复迭代，达到次数上限后输出结果。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#334B60","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a1g3m9k7","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":1120,"top":650,"width":80,"height":30},"text":"06","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#7B8D9F","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6xp5i1","slideIndex":5,"text":""}
