{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lkre1c3e","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":115,"width":1120,"height":100},"text":"结果如何理解","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":36,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#142A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kjids7mt","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":80,"top":245,"width":1100,"height":390},"text":"假设最终得到 [0, 1, 2, 0]。\n任务 1、4 本地执行，任务 2、3 分别卸载至 A、B。\n可与全本地、随机分配等方案比较总时延。\n本例仅说明原理，未运行实验，不代表实际性能提升。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#334B60","alignment":"left"}}
